  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">Models &amp; Where Each Dataset Lives</h2>
  
    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-8 mb-6">
      The two syntax datasets use separate models and tables, so they never
      overwrite each other. Shared dictionaries (roots, lemmas) are linked
      from both.
